      "id": "custom_hilbert_constraints__a202136a3fd70552ecbc1a6ad0f2024f__sec_6_6__0",
      "text": "## Integration with Variational States#\nConstrained Hilbert spaces work seamlessly with all NetKet variational states:\n```code\n# Create constrained system\nhilbert\n=\nnk\n.\nhilbert\n.\nSpin\n(\n0.5\n,\nN\n=\n10\n,\nconstraint\n=\nSumConstraint\n(\n0\n))\n# Zero magnetization\ngraph\n=\nnk\n.\ngraph\n.\nChain\n(\n10\n)\nhamiltonian\n=\nnk\n.\noperator\n.\nIsing\n(\nhilbert\n,\ngraph\n,\nh\n=\n1.0\n)\n# Standard NetKet workflow\nmodel\n=\nnk\n.\nmodels\n.\nRBM\n(\nalpha\n=\n1\n)\nsampler\n=\nnk\n.\nsampler\n.\nMetropolisExchange\n(\nhilbert\n,\ngraph\n)\n# Respects magnetization\nvstate\n=\nnk\n.\nvqs\n.\nMCState\n(\nsampler\n,\nmodel\n)\n# Optimization works as usual\noptimizer\n=\nnk\n.\noptimizer\n.\nSgd\n(\n0.01\n)\ndriver\n=\nnk\n.\ndriver\n.\nVMC\n(\nhamiltonian\n,\noptimizer\n)\ndriver\n.\nrun\n(\nvstate\n,\nn_iter\n=\n100\n)\n```",
